        "id": "sage-twgzgkzc6hr4",
        "sourceId": "sage",
        "url": "https://status.sage.com/incidents/twgzgkzc6hr4",
        "title": "Brightpearl - Partial Outage",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-01T18:14:19.000Z",
        "content": "&lt;p&gt; &lt;small&gt;Oct &lt;var data-var=&apos;date&apos;&gt; 1&lt;/var&gt;, &lt;var data-var=&apos;time&apos;&gt;18:14&lt;/var&gt; UTC&lt;/small&gt;&lt;br&gt; &lt;strong&gt;Update&lt;/strong&gt; - We have identified a global issue preventing customer from using all functionality in the eBay integration. All other product functionalities are performing as expected.&lt;br /&gt;We are currently investigating. &lt;/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;small&gt;Oct &lt;var data-var=&apos;date&apos;&gt; 1&lt;/var&gt;, &lt;var data-var=&apos;time&apos;&gt;18:04&lt;/var&gt; UTC&lt;/small&gt;&lt;br&gt; &lt;strong&gt;Investigating&lt;/strong&gt; - We are investigating a potential issue with the service. An update will be provided within 30 minutes. &lt;/p&gt;",
