      {
        "id": "esker-environment-E",
        "url": "https://www.trustesker.com/?env=E",
        "title": "TrustEsker environnement E",
        "publishedAt": null,
        "noticeVisible": true,
        "content": "<div class='message message_ProductionIncident_orange'><div class='icon'></div><div class='txt'><ul><li><b>2026-10-01 16:18 UTC</b>: &nbsp;<p><em><strong>Investigating</strong> - Esker on Demand response time degradation - 4:14pm UTC</em><br>Platform performance has improved and processing times are currently closer to expected levels.<br>Our investigation remains ongoing to determine the root cause of the issue. Although the overall impact has decreased, some intermittent slowdowns may still be observed while the situation continues to be monitored.<br>We will share further updates as soon as more information becomes available.</p>\n\n<p><br><em><strong>Investigating</strong> - Esker on Demand response time degradation - 1:17pm UTC</em><br>Our R&D team continues to analyze the situation and work toward restoring nominal performance.<br>We will provide further updates as soon as additional information becomes available.<br> </p>\n\n<p><em><strong>Investigating</strong> - Esker on Demand response time degradation - 10:17am UTC</em><br>We are currently experiencing an issue with our Esker on Demand platform which may result in processing delays.<br>Our emergency team is working to fix the problem. We apologize for any inconvenience this may cause.</p></li></ul></div></div>\t\t\t\n\t",
        "fingerprint": "62e035a082ee873530ff79b02aedaa2cdfef00b380697898a67a540080cb1036",
